{
  "book": "jacob",
  "bookName": "Jacob",
  "chapter": 7,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 446.76,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.344,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now it came to pass after some years had passed away,",
      "verse": "7:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 3.524,
      "end": 8.261,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "there came a man among the people of Nephi, whose name was Sherem.",
      "verse": "7:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 8.941,
      "end": 12.285,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that he began to preach among the people,",
      "verse": "7:2",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 12.465,
      "end": 15.437,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to declare unto them that there should be no Christ.",
      "verse": "7:2",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 15.617,
      "end": 20.029,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he preached many things which were flattering unto the people;",
      "verse": "7:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 20.209,
      "end": 24.017,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and this he did that he might overthrow the doctrine of Christ.",
      "verse": "7:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 24.697,
      "end": 26.555,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he labored diligently",
      "verse": "7:3",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 26.735,
      "end": 32.401,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he might lead away the hearts of the people, insomuch that he did lead away many hearts;",
      "verse": "7:3",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 32.581,
      "end": 36.714,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he knowing that I, Jacob, had faith in Christ who should come,",
      "verse": "7:3",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 36.894,
      "end": 40.238,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he sought much opportunity that he might come unto me.",
      "verse": "7:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 40.918,
      "end": 45.655,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he was learned, that he had a perfect knowledge of the language of the people;",
      "verse": "7:4",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 45.835,
      "end": 48.575,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, he could use much flattery,",
      "verse": "7:4",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 48.755,
      "end": 52.052,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and much power of speech, according to the power of the devil.",
      "verse": "7:4",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 52.732,
      "end": 55.286,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he had hope to shake me from the faith,",
      "verse": "7:5",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 55.466,
      "end": 57.974,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "notwithstanding the many revelations",
      "verse": "7:5",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 58.154,
      "end": 61.683,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the many things which I had seen concerning these things;",
      "verse": "7:5",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 61.863,
      "end": 63.906,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I truly had seen angels,",
      "verse": "7:5",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 64.086,
      "end": 66.129,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they had ministered unto me.",
      "verse": "7:5",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 66.309,
      "end": 73.043,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And also, I had heard the voice of the Lord speaking unto me in very word, from time to time;",
      "verse": "7:5",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 73.223,
      "end": 75.499,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, I could not be shaken.",
      "verse": "7:5",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 76.179,
      "end": 78.687,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that he came unto me,",
      "verse": "7:6",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 78.867,
      "end": 81.7,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and on this wise did he speak unto me, saying:",
      "verse": "7:6",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 81.88,
      "end": 84.899,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Brother Jacob, I have sought much opportunity",
      "verse": "7:6",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 85.079,
      "end": 87.029,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I might speak unto you;",
      "verse": "7:6",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 87.209,
      "end": 91.296,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I have heard and also know that thou goest about much,",
      "verse": "7:6",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 91.476,
      "end": 96.12,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "preaching that which ye call the gospel, or the doctrine of Christ.",
      "verse": "7:6",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 96.8,
      "end": 99.029,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And ye have led away much of this people",
      "verse": "7:7",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 99.209,
      "end": 101.81,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they pervert the right way of God,",
      "verse": "7:7",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 101.99,
      "end": 104.126,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and keep not the law of Moses",
      "verse": "7:7",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 104.306,
      "end": 105.931,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which is the right way;",
      "verse": "7:7",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 106.111,
      "end": 109.687,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and convert the law of Moses into the worship of a being",
      "verse": "7:7",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 109.867,
      "end": 113.304,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which ye say shall come many hundred years hence.",
      "verse": "7:7",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 113.484,
      "end": 117.664,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now behold, I, Sherem, declare unto you that this is blasphemy;",
      "verse": "7:7",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 117.844,
      "end": 120.212,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for no man knoweth of such things;",
      "verse": "7:7",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 120.392,
      "end": 122.714,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he cannot tell of things to come.",
      "verse": "7:7",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 122.894,
      "end": 126.145,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And after this manner did Sherem contend against me.",
      "verse": "7:7",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 126.825,
      "end": 134.07,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, the Lord God poured in his Spirit into my soul, insomuch that I did confound him in all his words.",
      "verse": "7:8",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 134.75,
      "end": 136.375,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I said unto him:",
      "verse": "7:9",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 136.555,
      "end": 138.831,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Deniest thou the Christ who shall come?",
      "verse": "7:9",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 139.011,
      "end": 141.751,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he said: If there should be a Christ,",
      "verse": "7:9",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 141.931,
      "end": 143.51,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I would not deny him;",
      "verse": "7:9",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 143.69,
      "end": 145.64,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but I know that there is no Christ,",
      "verse": "7:9",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 145.82,
      "end": 148.142,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither has been, nor ever will be.",
      "verse": "7:9",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 148.822,
      "end": 150.447,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I said unto him:",
      "verse": "7:10",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 150.627,
      "end": 152.392,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Believest thou the scriptures?",
      "verse": "7:10",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 152.572,
      "end": 153.779,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he said, Yea.",
      "verse": "7:10",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 154.459,
      "end": 156.084,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I said unto him:",
      "verse": "7:11",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 156.264,
      "end": 158.447,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Then ye do not understand them;",
      "verse": "7:11",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 158.627,
      "end": 160.995,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they truly testify of Christ.",
      "verse": "7:11",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 161.175,
      "end": 162.708,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, I say unto you",
      "verse": "7:11",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 162.888,
      "end": 166.557,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that none of the prophets have written, nor prophesied,",
      "verse": "7:11",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 166.737,
      "end": 169.338,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save they have spoken concerning this Christ.",
      "verse": "7:11",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 170.018,
      "end": 171.458,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And this is not all\u2014",
      "verse": "7:12",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 171.638,
      "end": 174.053,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "it has been made manifest unto me,",
      "verse": "7:12",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 174.233,
      "end": 176.23,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I have heard and seen;",
      "verse": "7:12",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 176.41,
      "end": 181.054,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it also has been made manifest unto me by the power of the Holy Ghost;",
      "verse": "7:12",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 181.234,
      "end": 184.485,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, I know if there should be no atonement made",
      "verse": "7:12",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 184.665,
      "end": 186.476,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "all mankind must be lost.",
      "verse": "7:12",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 187.156,
      "end": 189.571,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that he said unto me:",
      "verse": "7:13",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 189.751,
      "end": 192.63,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Show me a sign by this power of the Holy Ghost,",
      "verse": "7:13",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 192.81,
      "end": 194.621,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in the which ye know so much.",
      "verse": "7:13",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 195.301,
      "end": 196.926,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I said unto him:",
      "verse": "7:14",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 197.106,
      "end": 200.868,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "What am I that I should tempt God to show unto thee a sign",
      "verse": "7:14",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 201.048,
      "end": 203.463,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in the thing which thou knowest to be true?",
      "verse": "7:14",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 203.643,
      "end": 205.361,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yet thou wilt deny it,",
      "verse": "7:14",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 205.541,
      "end": 207.677,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because thou art of the devil.",
      "verse": "7:14",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 207.857,
      "end": 209.947,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Nevertheless, not my will be done;",
      "verse": "7:14",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 210.127,
      "end": 212.077,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but if God shall smite thee,",
      "verse": "7:14",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 212.257,
      "end": 214.533,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "let that be a sign unto thee",
      "verse": "7:14",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 214.713,
      "end": 217.964,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he has power, both in heaven and in earth;",
      "verse": "7:14",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 218.144,
      "end": 220.512,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also, that Christ shall come.",
      "verse": "7:14",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 220.692,
      "end": 223.339,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thy will, O Lord, be done, and not mine.",
      "verse": "7:14",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 224.019,
      "end": 228.106,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that when I, Jacob, had spoken these words,",
      "verse": "7:15",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 228.286,
      "end": 233.162,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the power of the Lord came upon him, insomuch that he fell to the earth.",
      "verse": "7:15",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 233.342,
      "end": 238.45,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that he was nourished for the space of many days.",
      "verse": "7:15",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 239.13,
      "end": 242.427,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that he said unto the people:",
      "verse": "7:16",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 242.607,
      "end": 245.579,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Gather together on the morrow, for I shall die;",
      "verse": "7:16",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 245.759,
      "end": 249.66,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, I desire to speak unto the people before I shall die.",
      "verse": "7:16",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 250.34,
      "end": 255.309,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that on the morrow the multitude were gathered together;",
      "verse": "7:17",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 255.489,
      "end": 257.393,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he spake plainly unto them",
      "verse": "7:17",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 257.573,
      "end": 260.127,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and denied the things which he had taught them,",
      "verse": "7:17",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 260.307,
      "end": 264.997,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and confessed the Christ, and the power of the Holy Ghost, and the ministering of angels.",
      "verse": "7:17",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 265.677,
      "end": 270.832,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he spake plainly unto them, that he had been deceived by the power of the devil.",
      "verse": "7:18",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 271.012,
      "end": 275.563,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he spake of hell, and of eternity, and of eternal punishment.",
      "verse": "7:18",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 276.243,
      "end": 277.543,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he said:",
      "verse": "7:19",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 277.723,
      "end": 280.927,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I fear lest I have committed the unpardonable sin,",
      "verse": "7:19",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 281.107,
      "end": 283.011,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I have lied unto God;",
      "verse": "7:19",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 283.191,
      "end": 284.863,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I denied the Christ,",
      "verse": "7:19",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 285.043,
      "end": 287.319,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and said that I believed the scriptures;",
      "verse": "7:19",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 287.499,
      "end": 289.589,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they truly testify of him.",
      "verse": "7:19",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 289.769,
      "end": 292.37,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And because I have thus lied unto God",
      "verse": "7:19",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 292.55,
      "end": 295.197,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I greatly fear lest my case shall be awful;",
      "verse": "7:19",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 295.377,
      "end": 297.002,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but I confess unto God.",
      "verse": "7:19",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 297.682,
      "end": 300.793,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that when he had said these words",
      "verse": "7:20",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 300.973,
      "end": 303.806,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he could say no more, and he gave up the ghost.",
      "verse": "7:20",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 304.486,
      "end": 310.523,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And when the multitude had witnessed that he spake these things as he was about to give up the ghost,",
      "verse": "7:21",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 310.703,
      "end": 312.886,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they were astonished exceedingly;",
      "verse": "7:21",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 313.066,
      "end": 316.363,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "insomuch that the power of God came down upon them,",
      "verse": "7:21",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 316.543,
      "end": 319.84,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they were overcome that they fell to the earth.",
      "verse": "7:21",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 320.52,
      "end": 323.214,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now, this thing was pleasing unto me, Jacob,",
      "verse": "7:22",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 323.394,
      "end": 326.831,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I had requested it of my Father who was in heaven;",
      "verse": "7:22",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 327.011,
      "end": 329.937,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he had heard my cry and answered my prayer.",
      "verse": "7:22",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 330.617,
      "end": 336.747,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that peace and the love of God was restored again among the people;",
      "verse": "7:23",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 336.927,
      "end": 339.063,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they searched the scriptures,",
      "verse": "7:23",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 339.243,
      "end": 342.726,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and hearkened no more to the words of this wicked man.",
      "verse": "7:23",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 343.406,
      "end": 346.378,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that many means were devised",
      "verse": "7:24",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 346.558,
      "end": 350.645,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to reclaim and restore the Lamanites to the knowledge of the truth;",
      "verse": "7:24",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 350.825,
      "end": 352.404,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but it all was vain,",
      "verse": "7:24",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 352.584,
      "end": 355.417,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they delighted in wars and bloodshed,",
      "verse": "7:24",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 355.597,
      "end": 358.801,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they had an eternal hatred against us, their brethren.",
      "verse": "7:24",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 358.981,
      "end": 363.439,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they sought by the power of their arms to destroy us continually.",
      "verse": "7:24",
      "lineIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "start": 364.119,
      "end": 368.206,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, the people of Nephi did fortify against them",
      "verse": "7:25",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 368.386,
      "end": 371.172,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "with their arms, and with all their might,",
      "verse": "7:25",
      "lineIndex": 115
    },
    {
      "start": 371.352,
      "end": 374.556,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "trusting in the God and rock of their salvation;",
      "verse": "7:25",
      "lineIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "start": 374.736,
      "end": 379.008,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, they became as yet, conquerors of their enemies.",
      "verse": "7:25",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 379.688,
      "end": 383.125,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that I, Jacob, began to be old;",
      "verse": "7:26",
      "lineIndex": 118
    },
    {
      "start": 383.305,
      "end": 387.392,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the record of this people being kept on the other plates of Nephi,",
      "verse": "7:26",
      "lineIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "start": 387.572,
      "end": 390.08,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, I conclude this record,",
      "verse": "7:26",
      "lineIndex": 120
    },
    {
      "start": 390.26,
      "end": 393.882,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "declaring that I have written according to the best of my knowledge,",
      "verse": "7:26",
      "lineIndex": 121
    },
    {
      "start": 394.062,
      "end": 397.034,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "by saying that the time passed away with us,",
      "verse": "7:26",
      "lineIndex": 122
    },
    {
      "start": 397.214,
      "end": 399.397,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also our lives passed away",
      "verse": "7:26",
      "lineIndex": 123
    },
    {
      "start": 399.577,
      "end": 402.178,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "like as it were unto us a dream,",
      "verse": "7:26",
      "lineIndex": 124
    },
    {
      "start": 402.358,
      "end": 404.819,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "we being a lonesome and a solemn people,",
      "verse": "7:26",
      "lineIndex": 125
    },
    {
      "start": 404.999,
      "end": 407.507,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wanderers, cast out from Jerusalem,",
      "verse": "7:26",
      "lineIndex": 126
    },
    {
      "start": 407.687,
      "end": 410.381,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "born in tribulation, in a wilderness,",
      "verse": "7:26",
      "lineIndex": 127
    },
    {
      "start": 410.561,
      "end": 412.419,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and hated of our brethren,",
      "verse": "7:26",
      "lineIndex": 128
    },
    {
      "start": 412.599,
      "end": 415.293,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which caused wars and contentions;",
      "verse": "7:26",
      "lineIndex": 129
    },
    {
      "start": 415.473,
      "end": 417.888,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, we did mourn out our days.",
      "verse": "7:26",
      "lineIndex": 130
    },
    {
      "start": 418.568,
      "end": 422.144,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I, Jacob, saw that I must soon go down to my grave;",
      "verse": "7:27",
      "lineIndex": 131
    },
    {
      "start": 422.324,
      "end": 424.878,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, I said unto my son Enos:",
      "verse": "7:27",
      "lineIndex": 132
    },
    {
      "start": 425.058,
      "end": 426.498,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Take these plates.",
      "verse": "7:27",
      "lineIndex": 133
    },
    {
      "start": 426.678,
      "end": 430.3,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I told him the things which my brother Nephi had commanded me,",
      "verse": "7:27",
      "lineIndex": 134
    },
    {
      "start": 430.48,
      "end": 432.756,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he promised obedience unto the commands.",
      "verse": "7:27",
      "lineIndex": 135
    },
    {
      "start": 432.936,
      "end": 436.187,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I make an end of my writing upon these plates,",
      "verse": "7:27",
      "lineIndex": 136
    },
    {
      "start": 436.367,
      "end": 438.317,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which writing has been small;",
      "verse": "7:27",
      "lineIndex": 137
    },
    {
      "start": 438.497,
      "end": 440.726,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to the reader I bid farewell,",
      "verse": "7:27",
      "lineIndex": 138
    },
    {
      "start": 440.906,
      "end": 444.343,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "hoping that many of my brethren may read my words.",
      "verse": "7:27",
      "lineIndex": 139
    },
    {
      "start": 444.523,
      "end": 446.102,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Brethren, adieu.",
      "verse": "7:27",
      "lineIndex": 140
    }
  ]
}